---
title: Strawberry & Romaine Salad
author: Mary Arntson
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@Romaine lettuce{1%head} (washed and torn)
@red onion{1} (sliced)
@fresh strawberries (sliced)
@mayonnaise{2%c}
@raspberry vinegar{1/3%c}
@raspberry jam{2-3%Tbsp}
@sugar{2/3%c}
@light cream{1/3%c}
@poppy seeds{2%Tbsp}

Mix @Romaine lettuce{1%head}, @red onion{1}, and fresh strawberries.

==Dressing==
Mix @mayonnaise{2%c}, @raspberry vinegar{1/3%c}, @raspberry jam{2-3%Tbsp}, @sugar{2/3%c}, @light cream{1/3%c}, and @poppy seeds{2%Tbsp}. Put on salad just before serving.
